","provisional":true,"estimated":false},"unFigure":{"value":59035309,"what":"UN figure for the same day (between its 1 July 2025 and 2026 figures)","date":"2026-01-01","forecast":true},"notes":["Postcensal estimates."],"gapPct":0.2,"verdict":"matches","links":[{"label":"Eurostat: population on 1 January (demo_gind)","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/demo_gind/default/table?lang=en"}]},{"key":"census","kind":"unsd","asOf":"2026-10-05","figure":{"value":59030133,"what":"people counted by the census","date":"2021-10-01","provisional":false,"estimated":false},"unFigure":{"value":59701565,"what":"UN figure for the census day","date":"2021-10-01","forecast":false},"gapPct":1.1,"verdict":"matches","partial":false,"unUsedUpTo":2011,"notes":[],"links":[{"label":"UN Statistics Division: latest census and estimates (table 2)","href":"https://unstats.un.org/unsd/demographic-social/products/vitstats/seratab2.pdf"}]},{"key":"births","kind":"unsd","asOf":"2026-10-05","figure":{"value":369944,"what":"births registered (registration reported as virtually complete)","date":"2024","provisional":false,"estimated":false},"notes":[],"unFigure":{"value":384703,"what":"UN figure for 2024","date":"2024","forecast":true},"gapPct":4,"verdict":"un-higher","links":[{"label":"UN Statistics Division: births and deaths (table 3)","href":"https://unstats.un.org/unsd/demographic-social/products/vitstats/seratab3.pdf"}]},{"key":"deaths","kind":"unsd","asOf":"2026-10-05","figure":{"value":653109,"what":"deaths registered (registration reported as virtually complete)","date":"2024","provisional":false,"estimated":false},"notes":[],"unFigure":{"value":664494,"what":"UN figure for 2024","date":"2024","forecast":true},"gapPct":1.7,"verdict":"matches","links":[{"label":"UN Statistics Division: births and deaths (table 3)","href":"https://unstats.un.org/unsd/demographic-social/products/vitstats/seratab3.pdf"}]},{"key":"immigrants","kind":"eurostat","asOf":"2026-09-25","figure":{"value":6928045,"what":"people living there who were born in another country, on 1 January","date":"2025-01-01","provisional":false,"estimated":false},"unFigure":{"value":6553671,"what":"UN DESA estimate for mid-2024","date":"2024-07-01","forecast":false},"gapPct":-5.4,"verdict":"un-lower","unAddsRefugees":true,"notes":[],"links":[{"label":"Eurostat: population by country of birth (migr_pop3ctb)","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/migr_pop3ctb/default/table?lang=en"}]},{"key":"today","kind":"researched","text":"Italy's statistics office (ISTAT) counted 58,943,673 residents on 30 June 2026 (first provisional data), 845 fewer than at the start of the year. The UN's figure for 1 July 2026, 58.93 million, is 0.03% lower, so they match.","figure":{"value":58943673,"what":"resident population, first provisional data from the population register","date":"2026-06-30"},"unFigure":{"value":58926166,"what":"UN forecast for 1 July 2026","date":""},"gapPct":0,"verdict":"matches","links":[{"label":"ISTAT, Bilancio demografico mensile – giugno 2026, 11 Sep 2026","href":"https://www.istat.it/sistema-informativo-6/bilancio-demografico-mensile-giugno-2026/"}],"quotes":[{"text":"Al 30 giugno 2026, secondo i primi dati provvisori, la popolazione residente in Italia ammonta a 58.943.673 unità, in diminuzione di sole 845 unità rispetto all’inizio dell’anno (-0,01 per mille abitanti).","href":"https://www.istat.it/sistema-informativo-6/bilancio-demografico-mensile-giugno-2026/"}],"accessed":"2026-10-29"},{"key":"net","kind":"researched","text":"ISTAT recorded 440,000 arrivals from abroad in 2025 and 144,000 departures, a net gain of about 296,000; Italian citizens alone had a net loss of 53,000. The UN expects a net gain of 75,448 for 2025, about a quarter of ISTAT's figure.","figure":{"value":296000,"what":"net migration with other countries (provisional, rounded to thousands by the source)","date":"2025"},"unFigure":{"value":75448,"what":"UN forecast net migration for 2025","date":""},"gapPct":-74.5,"verdict":"un-lower","links":[{"label":"ISTAT, Indicatori demografici – Anno 2025 (PDF), Mar 2026","href":"https://www.istat.it/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Report_Indicatori-demografici_Anno-2025.pdf"}],"quotes":[{"text":"Le immigrazioni dall’estero sono 440mila, le emigrazioni per l’estero 144mila.","href":"https://www.istat.it/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Report_Indicatori-demografici_Anno-2025.pdf"},{"text":"Il saldo migratorio complessivo con l’estero, pari a circa +296mila unità, è il risultato di due dinamiche opposte: da un lato, il guadagno dovuto alle immigrazioni di cittadini stranieri (+348mila), dall’altro la perdita di cittadini italiani (-53mila)","href":"https://www.istat.it/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Report_Indicatori-demografici_Anno-2025.pdf"}],"accessed":"2026-10-29"}],"links":{"self":"https://fertility-tracker-live.vercel.app/api/v1/countries/ITA.json","countries":"https://fertility-tracker-live.vercel.app/api/v1/countries.json","risk":"https://fertility-tracker-live.vercel.app/api/v1/risk.json","docs":"https://fertility-tracker-live.vercel.app/api/","site":"https://fertility-tracker-live.vercel.app/country/ITA"}}
